flowchart LR
    A[Ride trip: matching] --> B{Live zone fairness policy?}
    B -- no --> X[Do not issue opaque offer]
    B -- yes --> C{Pickup distance and ETA\nwithin policy caps?}
    C -- no --> Y[Skip candidate\nreason recorded by worker]
    C -- yes --> D{Driver available, eligible,\nactive, clear, integrity threshold met?}
    D -- no --> Y
    D -- yes --> E[Lock presence with\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED]
    E --> F[Create pending offer]
    F --> G[Persist disclosure:\ndestination, route, gross fare, fees,\ncommission, expected proceeds]
    G --> H{Driver decision}
    H -- accept --> I{Disclosure exists?}
    I -- no --> J[Reject acceptance]
    I -- yes --> K[Existing accepted-trip transition]
    H -- decline --> L[Lock offer and verify driver ownership]
    L --> M[Persist reason-coded decline\nand immutable rematch decision]
    M --> N[Restore driver presence to available]
    N --> O[Emit one outbox event]
    O --> P{Other valid offers remain?}
    P -- no --> Q[Rematch required]
    P -- yes --> R[No immediate rematch]

    style X fill:#7f1d1d,color:#fff
    style J fill:#7f1d1d,color:#fff
    style G fill:#164e63,color:#fff
    style M fill:#14532d,color:#fff
